From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergei Sveshnikov <sergei@svesh.dev>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:48:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] Reconnect delays per account, next to the chunk size

- Account field imap_reconnect_delays ("30,60,120"; "0" = no wait;
  absent = server default BICHON_IMAP_RECONNECT_DELAYS, else 30,60,120),
  create/update/view, clear_imap_reconnect_delays; validated in the API
  and the form (whole seconds, up to 10 values). Gentle mode only.
- Web UI: "Reconnect delays" in the account's download settings and
  details; the chunk size description now says it bounds every response.
- Tests: account API roundtrip for the delays, schema tests, account
  delays over the server default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
